      description: "Sets normal base population capacity for each climate and planet size.",
      remarks: "Used only when population_capacity_table_enabled is true. Rows run from Toxic through Gaia; columns run from Tiny through Huge. Defaults reproduce the classic formula.",
      examples: ["colony population_capacity_table terran medium = 12;", "colony population_capacity_table gaia = 5 10 15 20 25;"],
      units: "population",
