      remarks: "Used only when population_capacity_table_enabled is true, without applying pop_bonus tolerant. Rows run from Toxic through Gaia; columns run from Tiny through Huge. Defaults reproduce the classic formula with a 25-percentage-point Tolerant bonus.",
