      description: "Configures experience thresholds and combat bonuses for every crew quality.",
      remarks: "The five rows are shared by crew advancement, tactical and strategic combat, boarding, and generated ships.",
      examples: [
        "combat crew veteran experience = 150;",
        "combat crew elite attack = 50;",
        "combat crew ultra_elite ground = 20;",
