      remarks: "The generator's global turn-50 gate still applies, so values below 50 do not permit earlier selection. Hyperspace flux additionally blocks comet and space-monster events. Mutiny and Warp Funnel retain their native table positions even though the original event generator does not complete them. Unlike MOO2 1.50 CFG files, use mineral_depletion instead of overworking for event 11.",
